#guard pins "?\n  ?\n    - a\n   ? b\n: w\n" == ("scan-refused L4YAML.ScanError.trailingContent 3 3", "ERR L4YAML.ScanError.trailingContent 3 3")

/-! …and to the RIGHT of the content there is no `?` indicator at all — a plain
