#guard pins "?\n  ?\n    - a\n? b\n: w\n" == ("scan-accepted", "+STR +DOC +MAP +MAP +SEQ =VAL :a -SEQ =VAL : -MAP =VAL : =VAL :b =VAL :w -MAP -DOC -STR")

/-! **The second ask, measured and handed forward.**  `pendingMapValue.h_kslot`
